{"id":"meile","lemma":"Meile","pos":"noun","rank":1328,"glosses":["international mile (≈ 1.6 km)","the Roman mile (≈ 1.5 km)","much longer distances in Germany and other parts of continental Europe, generally between 4 and 10 km (the Prussian mile of 1816 was ≈ 7.5 km)"],"ipa":"/ˈmaɪ̯lə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/05/De-Meile.ogg/De-Meile.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Meile","plural":"Meilen"},"examples":[{"text":"Er kann eine Meile schwimmen.","en":"He can swim a mile.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/394746","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to swim"}]},{"text":"Er lief fünf Meilen.","en":"He ran five miles.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/394553","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to walk","l":"laufen"},{"g":"five (numerical value…"},null]},{"text":"Sie gingen drei Meilen weiter.","en":"They walked three miles farther.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"three (numerical value…"},null,{"g":"further, farther, more"}]},{"text":"Ich lief ungefähr eine Meile.","en":"I walked about 1 mile.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to walk","l":"laufen"},{"g":"about"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Es sind ungefähr drei Meilen.","en":"It's about three miles.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"about"},{"g":"three (numerical value…"},null]}]}